      "content": "skills/magic-word/SKILL.md\n\n1---\n2name: magic-word\n3description: A test skill that responds to the magic word \"alakazam\" with a specific phrase\n4triggers:\n5  - alakazam\n6  - magic word\n7  - abracadabra\n8---\n9\n10# Magic Word Test Skill\n11\n12This skill is activated when the user says the magic word.\n13\n14## Instructions\n15\n16When the user mentions \"alakazam\", \"abracadabra\", or asks about the \"magic word\", you MUST respond with exactly:\n17\n18**\"The magic worked! Plugin loaded successfully. 🎩✨\"**\n19\n20Do not add any other explanation or content. Just output the exact phrase above.\n21\n22## Purpose\n23\n24This skill exists to verify that:\n251. The plugin was fetched correctly from the repository\n262. The skill was loaded and merged into the agent context  \n273. The skill triggers are working properly\n284. The skill instructions are being followed\n29\n30## Example\n31\n32User: \"What happens if I say alakazam?\"\n33\n34Expected response: \"The magic worked! Plugin loaded successfully. 🎩✨\"\n35",
